# The roots of a64.sail the RISC back ends generate (sailgen --generate with risc.h and risc_a64.h, cmake/sailgen.cmake):
# a64_x64.roots' (copied below as they are), and the Advanced SIMD and SIMD&FP loads and stores sailgen makes for a
# machine without vector registers: the vectors as general-purpose doublewords, element by element (gen.c without
# lanes). The SIMD clauses not here (reals, integer arithmetic sailgen keeps only when it recompiles, nested halving
# reductions) are another back end's
